  // ---- Its look, and its pose ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // The drawing it is in this tick: frame a carried t of the way to frame b's pose - or, past half way,
  // frame b carried back the rest; with no carrying worked out between the two, the one giving way to
  // the other cell by cell. Laid in a grid about its body point (cells, the drawing's own), mirrored
  // to face its way.
